yMORE HINTS AND STRATEGIES (NO ONE
KNOWS THESE EXCEPT YOU):

g1) TRY NOT TO LET YOUR SPELL POINTS
DROP BELOW HALF OF THEIR MAXIMUM.

b2) IF YOU CAN CURE YOURSELF, DO SO.

r3) ANY TIME YOU SEE A LADDER GOING
DOWN, USE IT. IF YOU DON'T WANT TO
GO DOWN, THEN JUST COME RIGHT BACK
UP THE LADDER. THAT WAY, IF YOU
FALL DOWN A CHUTE LATER, YOU MIGHT
KNOW HOW TO GET BACK UP. THIS ALSO
HELPS TO MAP CHUTES.

b4) IF YOU FALL DOWN A CHUTE AND ARE
LOST, RUN AWAY FROM EVERYTHING. YOU
MAY NEED ALL OF THE HEALTH AND SPELL
POINTS YOU HAVE TO FIND YOUR WAY OUT.

o5) LEARN TO USE SPELLS EFFECTIVELY.
IT IS VERY HARD TO SUCCEED WITHOUT
THEM UNLESS YOU ARE A FIGHTER.

yHIT ANY KEY...
eX
yMORE HINTS AND STRATEGIES: (PAGE 2)

g6) WHEN YOU ARE READY TO GAIN A
LEVEL, GO TO AN INN RIGHT AWAY.
DON'T HOLD OUT FOR MORE EXPERIENCE.

b7) KEEP CONTROL OF YOUR INVENTORY.
YOU MAY NEED TO DROP VARIOUS ARMOR
AND WEAPONS OCCASIONALLY. EACH TIME
YOU FIND A SUIT OF ARMOR OR A
WEAPON, WEIGHT IS ADDED, AND IT IS
POSSIBLE TO CARRY SEVERAL SUITS OF
EACH KIND OF ARMOR.

r8) BE PERSISTENT. IN REAL LIFE,
SUCCESS DOES NOT COME EASILY, AND
HERE, SUCCESS IS ALSO KIND OF
DIFFICULT. THE GOOD THING IS THAT
YOU GET TO START OVER IF YOU FAIL.
THAT MAY OR MAY NOT BE THE CASE IN
REAL LIFE!

g9) WATCH OUT FOR BLACK AND GREEN
INSECTS. BLACK ONES POISON YOU, AND
GREEN ONES SPREAD DISEASE.

yHIT ANY KEY...
eX
yMORE HINTS AND STRATEGIES: (PAGE 3)

r10) WATCH OUT FOR LEVEL-DRAINING
MONSTERS THAT LOWER YOUR PLAYER
LEVEL EACH TIME THEY HIT YOU. THERE
WILL BE A NOTE BELOW THE MONSTER'S
INFORMATION WHEN YOU ARE IN BATTLE
TELLING YOU IF IT IS LIFE DRAINER.

g11) DO NOT JUST RUN UP AND ATTACK
MONSTERS. MAKE THEM COME TO YOU BY
HITTING 'ENTER' THIS IS A LITTLE
KNOWN FEATURE THAT WILL ALLOW YOU
TO WAIT FOR MONSTERS TO COME TO
YOU, SO THAT YOU CAN GET OFF THE
FIRST STRIKE. THIS IS ESPECIALLY
IMPORTANT WHEN FIGHTING LEVEL
DRAINERS AND INSECTS.

b12) IF YOU ARE ABLE TO USE A WEAPON,
GO TO A STORE AND BUY A CHEAP WEAPON
RIGHT AWAY, SO THAT YOU CAN FIGHT
WITH SOMETHING OTHER THAN YOUR FIST.

o13) DON'T TELL THESE SECRETS TO
ANYONE! EVER!

